A note-claimed fence line keeps the item loose

```
- item
  [^c]: [^d]: para
          more
   ~~~

  See[^c][^d]
.
<ul>
  <li>item
    <pre><code>
See[^c][^d]
</code></pre>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
1. item
   [^c]: para
    ~~~~

   See[^c]
.
<ol>
  <li>item
    <pre><code>
See[^c]
</code></pre>
  </li>
</ol>
```

````
:: term
: item
  [^c]: para
   ```

  See[^c]
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>item</p>
    <pre><code>
See[^c]
</code></pre>
  </dd>
</dl>
````
